     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "出身與法律教育",
      "en": "Origins and legal education"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "魯道夫·拉梅克1881年4月12日生於奧屬西里西亞的切欣（Teschen）。他是鐵路官員之子，在維也納大學修習法律，1907年取得法學博士學位。此後他的職業生涯轉向律師執業，並在1913年起於薩爾茨堡開業。",
      "en": "Rudolf Ramek was born on 12 April 1881 in Teschen, Austrian Silesia. He was the son of a railway official, studied law at the University of Vienna and took his doctorate in law in 1907. He then turned to legal practice, which led him to Salzburg from 1913."
     },
