     "periodStartPrecision": "day",
     "periodEndPrecision": "day",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "出任聯邦總理",
      "en": "Federal Chancellor"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "賽佩爾辭職後，把拉梅克推上前台作為過渡人選，他於1924年成為聯邦總理，任期自1924年11月20日至1926年10月20日。他的內閣必須在國際聯盟監督下完成已經展開的財政整頓。他最終敗於銀行倒閉的後果，並在1926年依賽佩爾所願辭職。",
      "en": "After Seipel's resignation, Seipel put Ramek forward as a placeholder, and he became Federal Chancellor in 1924, serving from 20 November 1924 to 20 October 1926. His cabinet had to complete the begun financial reconstruction under League of Nations control. He ultimately failed because of the consequences of the bank collapses and resigned in 1926 as Seipel wished."
     },
