     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "國民議會副議長與晚年",
      "en": "Second President of the National Council and later years"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1930年12月4日，拉梅克成為國民議會第二議長，任至1933年3月4日。1934年4月30日，他仍主持殘餘議會的會議。納粹時期，他擔任教會機構的法律顧問。他於1941年7月24日在維也納去世。",
      "en": "On 4 December 1930 Ramek became Second President of the National Council, serving until 4 March 1933. On 30 April 1934 he still chaired the session of the rump parliament. In the Nazi era he worked as legal adviser to church institutions. He died in Vienna on 24 July 1941."
     },
