     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "若槻禮次郎生於1866年3月21日，出身島根，為松江藩士之子。1892年自帝國大學法科大學畢業，1911年成為貴族院議員。",
      "en": "Wakatsuki Reijiro was born on 21 March 1866 in Shimane, the son of a Matsue clan samurai. He graduated from the Law College of the Imperial University in 1892 and became a member of the House of Peers in 1911."
     },
