     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "加藤高明內閣的內務大臣",
      "en": "Home Minister under Kato"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "他曾在第三次桂內閣擔任大藏大臣。1924年出任內務大臣。官方閣僚名簿亦列其為內務大臣。1926年1月28日加藤高明去世。",
      "en": "He served as Minister of Finance in the third Katsura cabinet. In 1924 he became Minister of Home Affairs. The official cabinet roster also lists him as Home Minister. Kato Takaaki died on 28 January 1926."
