     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "加藤高明去世當日，1926年1月28日，若槻禮次郎臨時兼任內閣總理大臣。1926年他正式出任首相。1931年再度出任首相。",
      "en": "On 28 January 1926, the day Kato died, Wakatsuki concurrently took over as acting Prime Minister. In 1926 he became Prime Minister. He resumed the premiership in 1931."
